	<section_number>45.2-908</section_number>
	<catch_line> Noxious fumes</catch_line>
	<text>
		Painting or any operation that creates noxious fumes shall be performed only in a well-ventilated atmosphere.
	</text>
	<history>Code 1950, § 45-85.5; 1954, c. 191; 1966, c. 594, § 45.1-34; 1978, c. 729; 1994, c. 28, § 45.1-161.261; 2021, Sp. Sess. I, c. 387.</history>
